+Blend shaders compile only the blend modes used by each surface. This keeps the same
+color and alpha calculations while avoiding driver compiler memory limits for
+small chains that include Lab or linear-light modes. Changing the mode set
+selects a matching shader; changing colors keeps the existing shader.
+
 ## Basic Usage

 Applying a backdrop blur involves three steps:
