 The reconciler classifies each change as `Push` / `Pop` / `MultiPush(n)` / `MultiPop(n)` / `Replace` / `ReplaceAll`, surfaced to transitions via `NavTransitionScope.change` so you can animate a multi-pop differently from a single pop.

+When a push interrupts a pop, the removed entry is unloaded as soon as a current entry occupies its stack position. The selected page appears immediately and keeps its content throughout a subsequent close. Only the uppermost visible entry owns the dim scrim, including the composition before replacement cleanup runs.
+
